(7592516, 1224453, 24983, '<td valign="top">what a magnificent example. hope he is a mouser I like him better than King Kong,you could rent him out to Peter Jackson for the sequel    7</td>', 'what a magnificent example. hope he is a mouser I like him better than King Kong,you could rent him out to Peter Jackson for the sequel    7', '2018-08-15 21:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592520, 1224652, 114285, '<td valign="top">Man those legs haha! Must be Arts grandkid ;)<br/> <br/> Anyway I love this really, the processing is epic, just one negative and that is I wish you didnt have the table in the background, Its a slight distraction, but Im thinking maybe this was just a candid and you didnt plan it,  and then you uploaded it onto your computer and thought WOW well this is a pretty special image of my grandson who knows, anyway Ill give you the benefit of the doubt. Once again your editing is spot on though, really my style!</td>', 'Man those legs haha! Must be Arts grandkid ;)  Anyway I love this really, the processing is epic, just one negative and that is I wish you didnt have the table in the background, Its a slight distraction, but Im thinking maybe this was just a candid and you didnt plan it,  and then you uploaded it onto your computer and thought WOW well this is a pretty special image of my grandson who knows, anyway Ill give you the benefit of the doubt. Once again your editing is spot on though, really my style!', '2018-08-15 22:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
