(7592602, 1224649, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever photographed one from above. I always go for the side view, for some reason. Maybe ''cuz the curve in the tail makes the bug look very oddly formed from this perspective. But that''s OK; it''s an Assassin Bug, and they''re weird-looking from any angle. Nice macro :-)</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever photographed one from above. I always go for the side view, for some reason. Maybe ''cuz the curve in the tail makes the bug look very oddly formed from this perspective. But that''s OK; it''s an Assassin Bug, and they''re weird-looking from any angle. Nice macro :-)', '2018-08-16 14:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
