(7592969, 1224571, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, normally I''m not a fan of photo collages, etc. that show up under the Extended rule set - however I have to say this is a cutting edge presentation that looks like a professionally done advertisement.  Maybe that''s what you do for a living?  Whatever ... the end result for this is pretty awesome and hard to discount as a "non-photo".  Well done.</td>', 'Ok, normally I''m not a fan of photo collages, etc. that show up under the Extended rule set - however I have to say this is a cutting edge presentation that looks like a professionally done advertisement.  Maybe that''s what you do for a living?  Whatever ... the end result for this is pretty awesome and hard to discount as a "non-photo".  Well done.', '2018-08-19 22:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
