(7593317, 1224571, 138630, '<td valign="top">Solidly in your corner, Anita, and one of your 10''s from early on in the week.  I never wavered.  This is wonderful and the tilt looked not at all unintentional or careless.  I agree that it''s much more dynamic than straight would have been.  I''m not sure why anyone would "discount as a non-photo" a collage in an Extended rule set challenge . . . I would have thought the opposite and that you would get extra points for that LOL  This is fine, really fine.  Congratulations on the Blue.</td>', 'Solidly in your corner, Anita, and one of your 10''s from early on in the week.  I never wavered.  This is wonderful and the tilt looked not at all unintentional or careless.  I agree that it''s much more dynamic than straight would have been.  I''m not sure why anyone would "discount as a non-photo" a collage in an Extended rule set challenge . . . I would have thought the opposite and that you would get extra points for that LOL  This is fine, really fine.  Congratulations on the Blue.', '2018-08-22 01:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
