(7593409, 1224652, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is too funny, when I saw it on FB, I actually thought this was a photo of you in your glory years. I didn''t even notice the plastic table, (not sure how I didn''t but there ya go)  So the PP work is brilliant! Saw it in the challenge and thought, well that might be a little out of the date range, or it is great mini-me Art.<br/> Give a quick hug and kiss to your grandson from me xox</td>', 'This is too funny, when I saw it on FB, I actually thought this was a photo of you in your glory years. I didn''t even notice the plastic table, (not sure how I didn''t but there ya go)  So the PP work is brilliant! Saw it in the challenge and thought, well that might be a little out of the date range, or it is great mini-me Art. Give a quick hug and kiss to your grandson from me xox', '2018-08-22 11:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
