(7593426, 1224571, 19825, '<td valign="top">The tilt works well to add impact. The obsessive in me automatically squares up everything in post processing. I suspect I might not have thought to try entering the tilt. Well played. For the EFS challenges I am always combing my shots for the month looking for images that might merge well together. You have chosen very well.</td>', 'The tilt works well to add impact. The obsessive in me automatically squares up everything in post processing. I suspect I might not have thought to try entering the tilt. Well played. For the EFS challenges I am always combing my shots for the month looking for images that might merge well together. You have chosen very well.', '2018-08-22 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
